          "text": "Description: A witness provides us with a photographic print that shows the presence of an object the witness did not see at the time the photo was taken. No specific date is provided by the witness (the witness referring to a weekend in September 2009). Post-hoc photo analysis, not involving direct observation, is often complicated. The unidentified object on photo 100_0726 appears to be a bird, with the underside of its dark wings visible in the shadow.",
